title=Necrons+Beginner+Army+Guide%3A+The+Easiest+Non-Marine+Start+%282026%29&slug=necrons-beginner-army-guide&content=%3Ch1%3ENecrons+Beginner+Army+Guide%3A+The+Easiest+Non-Marine+Start+%282026%29%3C%2Fh1%3E%0A%3Cp%3E%3Cstrong%3EShort+answer%3A%3C%2Fstrong%3E+Necrons+are+the+best+beginner+army+if+you+want+anything+other+than+Space+Marines%3A+simple+rules%2C+incredibly+durable+models+and+a+paint+scheme+that+looks+finished+after+a+basecoat%2C+a+wash+and+some+glowing+green.+Start+with+the+Necrons+half+of+a+starter+set+or+a+Combat+Patrol+box+and+you%27re+playing+legal+500-point+games+within+two+weekends.%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Cblockquote+class%3D%22wp-block-quote%22%3E%3Cp%3E%3Cem%3EDisclosure%3A+Grimdark+Builds+is+an+unofficial+fan+site.+Some+links+on+this+page+are+affiliate+links+%E2%80%94+if+you+buy+through+them%2C+we+may+earn+a+small+commission+at+no+extra+cost+to+you.+We+are+not+affiliated+with+or+endorsed+by+Games+Workshop.%3C%2Fem%3E%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Fblockquote%3E%0A%3Cp%3E%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Ch2%3EWhy+Necrons+Are+a+Perfect+First+Army%3C%2Fh2%3E%0A%3Cp%3ENecrons+are+ancient%2C+undying+robot+legions+%E2%80%94+and+mechanically%2C+they%27re+built+for+people+learning+the+game%3A%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Col%3E%0A%3Cli%3E%3Cstrong%3EReanimation+Protocols+forgive+mistakes.%3C%2Fstrong%3E+Your+fallen+warriors+stand+back+up.+While+you%27re+learning+positioning%2C+your+army+heals+your+errors.%3C%2Fli%3E%0A%3Cli%3E%3Cstrong%3EOne+simple+army+rule%2C+clean+datacards.%3C%2Fstrong%3E+Fewer+nested+special+rules+than+almost+any+other+faction+%E2%80%94+you+spend+game+nights+learning+40K%2C+not+Necron+exceptions.%3C%2Fli%3E%0A%3Cli%3E%3Cstrong%3EFastest+paint+scheme+in+the+game.%3C%2Fstrong%3E+Silver+basecoat+%2B+black+wash+%2B+green+accents+%3D+table-ready.+No+faction+gets+from+sprue+to+tabletop+faster.%3C%2Fli%3E%0A%3Cli%3E%3Cstrong%3ESmall+model+count.%3C%2Fstrong%3E+Most+Necron+lists+run+fewer+models+than+horde+armies+%E2%80%94+less+assembly%2C+less+painting%2C+less+cost+per+finished+game.%3C%2Fli%3E%0A%3C%2Fol%3E%0A%3Ch2%3EYour+First+1%2C000+Points+%28Simple+Starter+List%29%3C%2Fh2%3E%0A%3Cfigure+class%3D%22wp-block-table%22%3E%3Ctable%3E%3Cthead%3E%3Ctr%3E%3Cth%3EUnit%3C%2Fth%3E%3Cth%3ERole%3C%2Fth%3E%3Cth%3EWhy+It%27s+Here%3C%2Fth%3E%3C%2Ftr%3E%3C%2Fthead%3E%3Ctbody%3E%3Ctr%3E%3Ctd%3EOverlord+%28or+Royal+Warden%29%3C%2Ftd%3E%3Ctd%3ELeader%2C+buffs+Warriors%3C%2Ftd%3E%3Ctd%3ECheap+HQ+that+makes+your+core+hit+harder%3C%2Ftd%3E%3C%2Ftr%3E%3Ctr%3E%3Ctd%3E20x+Necron+Warriors%3C%2Ftd%3E%3Ctd%3EBattleline%2C+objective+holders%3C%2Ftd%3E%3Ctd%3EYour+durable+scoring+core+%E2%80%94+reanimation+keeps+them+alive%3C%2Ftd%3E%3C%2Ftr%3E%3Ctr%3E%3Ctd%3E3x+Skorpekh+Destroyers%3C%2Ftd%3E%3Ctd%3EMelee+threat%3C%2Ftd%3E%3Ctd%3ETeaches+aggressive+play+with+a+forgiving+unit%3C%2Ftd%3E%3C%2Ftr%3E%3Ctr%3E%3Ctd%3ECanoptek+Scarab+Swarms+or+Wraiths%3C%2Ftd%3E%3Ctd%3EFast+screen+%2F+speed%3C%2Ftd%3E%3Ctd%3EMovement-phase+learning+curve%2C+cheap+in+points%3C%2Ftd%3E%3C%2Ftr%3E%3Ctr%3E%3Ctd%3E1x+Heavy+support+%28Annihilation+Barge+or+similar%29%3C%2Ftd%3E%3Ctd%3ERanged+firepower%3C%2Ftd%3E%3Ctd%3EYour+first+%22big+gun%22+%E2%80%94+teaches+shooting+priority%3C%2Ftd%3E%3C%2Ftr%3E%3C%2Ftbody%3E%3C%2Ftable%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%0A%3Cp%3E%3Cem%3EPoint+values+change+with+each+dataslate+%E2%80%94+always+check+the+current+free+points+file.+The+structure+%28Warrior+core+%2B+leader+%2B+one+melee+%2B+one+fast+%2B+one+heavy%29+is+durable+across+updates.%3C%2Fem%3E%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Cp%3E%3Cstrong%3EExpansion+path%3A%3C%2Fstrong%3E+add+a+Monolith+or+a+C%27tan+Shard+as+your+2%2C000-point+centrepiece.+One+big+model+per+purchase+%E2%80%94+paint+it+before+the+next.%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Cp%3E%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Ch2%3EPaint+Scheme%3A+The+Weekend+Army%3C%2Fh2%3E%0A%3Cp%3EThe+famous+%22one+weekend%22+Necron+recipe%3A%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Col%3E%0A%3Cli%3E%3Cstrong%3ESpray%3C%2Fstrong%3E+black+or+grey+primer%3C%2Fli%3E%0A%3Cli%3E%3Cstrong%3EBasecoat%3C%2Fstrong%3E+everything+silver+%28one+coat+is+fine+on+metal%29%3C%2Fli%3E%0A%3Cli%3E%3Cstrong%3EWash%3C%2Fstrong%3E+with+black+shade+%E2%80%94+the+wash+does+the+entire+%22depth%22+job%3C%2Fli%3E%0A%3Cli%3E%3Cstrong%3EGlow+accents%3A%3C%2Fstrong%3E+drybrush+the+weapon+coils+and+eyes+in+green%2C+add+a+second+lighter+pass+on+the+brightest+spots%3C%2Fli%3E%0A%3C%2Fol%3E%0A%3Cp%3EFifteen+models+in+two+evenings%2C+and+they+look+like+a+proper+undying+legion.+Black-and-green+variants%2C+brass+trims+and+rusty+%22tomb+world%22+versions+all+come+later+%E2%80%94+the+base+scheme+is+genuinely+this+easy.%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Ch2%3EPlaying+Your+First+Games%3C%2Fh2%3E%0A%3Cul%3E%0A%3Cli%3E%3Cstrong%3EWarriors+in+the+middle.%3C%2Fstrong%3E+They%27re+your+objectives+team+%E2%80%94+march+them+up+the+board+and+let+reanimation+punish+your+opponent%27s+shooting.%3C%2Fli%3E%0A%3Cli%3E%3Cstrong%3EShoot+the+dangerous+stuff%2C+ignore+the+chaff.%3C%2Fstrong%3E+Necron+guns+are+good%3B+the+beginner+mistake+is+wasting+them+on+cheap+enemy+units.%3C%2Fli%3E%0A%3Cli%3E%3Cstrong%3EDon%27t+fear+melee.%3C%2Fstrong%3E+Even+when+Destroyers+die%2C+that%27s+their+job+%E2%80%94+buying+time+for+your+Warriors+to+score.%3C%2Fli%3E%0A%3C%2Ful%3E%0A%3Ch2%3ECommon+Necron+Beginner+Mistakes%3C%2Fh2%3E%0A%3Cul%3E%0A%3Cli%3E%3Cstrong%3ESpending+huge+points+on+one+giant+unit+too+early%3C%2Fstrong%3E+%E2%80%94+learn+with+a+balanced+core+first%3C%2Fli%3E%0A%3Cli%3E%3Cstrong%3EForgetting+reanimation+rolls%3C%2Fstrong%3E+%E2%80%94+it%27s+the+faction%27s+whole+identity%3B+write+it+on+your+army+roster%3C%2Fli%3E%0A%3Cli%3E%3Cstrong%3ELeaving+the+Overlord%27s+buff+out+of+range%3C%2Fstrong%3E+%E2%80%94+keep+leaders+glued+to+the+Warriors%3C%2Fli%3E%0A%3C%2Ful%3E%0A%3Ch2%3EFAQ+%E2%80%94+Necrons+for+Beginners%3C%2Fh2%3E%0A%3Cp%3E%3Cstrong%3EAre+Necrons+good+for+beginners%3F%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Cp%3EYes+%E2%80%94+arguably+the+best+non-Marine+start.+Simple+rules%2C+durable+units+and+a+fast+paint+scheme+make+them+ideal+while+you%27re+learning+movement%2C+shooting+and+objectives.%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Cp%3E%3Cstrong%3EHow+much+does+a+1%2C000-point+Necron+army+cost%3F%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Cp%3EAround+%24250%E2%80%93350+including+paints+and+tools.+The+Necrons+half+of+a+starter+box+plus+one+or+two+boxes+gets+you+most+of+the+way+there.%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Cp%3E%3Cstrong%3EWhat%27s+the+easiest+Necron+paint+scheme%3F%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Cp%3ESilver+basecoat%2C+black+wash%2C+glowing+green+accents.+It%27s+the+most+famous+beginner+scheme+in+the+hobby+for+a+reason+%E2%80%94+fifteen+models+in+a+weekend%2C+looking+genuinely+good.%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Cp%3E%3Cstrong%3ENecrons+vs.+Space+Marines+for+a+first+army%3F%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Cp%3EBoth+excellent.+Marines%3A+maximum+community+support+and+starter+availability.+Necrons%3A+better+looks-per-hour-of-painting+and+fewer+models+to+manage.+Read+our+%3Ca+href%3D%22%2Fbest-warhammer-40k-army-for-beginners%2F%22%3Efull+comparison%3C%2Fa%3E.%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Cp%3E%3Cstrong%3EDo+Necrons+have+complicated+rules%3F%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Cp%3ETheir+core+rules+are+simple+%E2%80%94+reanimation+is+one+mechanic%2C+and+most+units+are+straightforward+shooting+or+melee.+You%27ll+spend+more+time+learning+40K%27s+universal+rules+than+Necron-specific+exceptions.%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Cp%3E%3Cstrong%3EWhat+do+I+buy+after+the+starter+box%3F%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Cp%3EOne+Warrior+box+and+one+fast+or+melee+box+gets+you+to+1%2C000+points.+Add+your+first+big+centrepiece+%28Monolith+or+C%27tan%29+as+the+reward+for+finishing+your+paint+queue.%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Ch2%3EWake+the+Legion%3C%2Fh2%3E%0A%3Cul%3E%0A%3Cli%3E%F0%9F%91%89+%3Cstrong%3E%3Ca+href%3D%22%2Fhow-to-start-warhammer-40k%2F%22%3EHow+to+Start+Warhammer+40K%3A+Beginner%27s+Roadmap%3C%2Fa%3E%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Fli%3E%0A%3Cli%3E%F0%9F%91%89+%3Cstrong%3E%3Ca+href%3D%22%2Fbest-warhammer-40k-starter-set%2F%22%3EBest+Warhammer+40K+Starter+Set+in+2026+%28Compared%29%3C%2Fa%3E%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Fli%3E%0A%3Cli%3E%F0%9F%91%89+%3Cstrong%3E%3Ca+href%3D%22%2Fspace-marines-beginner-army-guide%2F%22%3ESpace+Marines+Beg